          {"id": "INV-006", "text": "The maximum permitted value for length_of_MODULUS is 1024 bytes (8192 bits)."},
          {"id": "INV-007", "text": "The upper bound constant is 1024 bytes = 8192 bits, same for all three fields."},
          {"id": "INV-008", "text": "The bound applies to each length field independently; there is no combined/aggregate limit."}
